🚀 TShark Mastery: High-Performance Network Forensics
While Wireshark provides a vital graphical interface for packet analysis, TShark (the command-line version of Wireshark) is the tool of choice for the modern SOC Analyst
. When dealing with multi-gigabyte packet captures (PCAPs) where a GUI would lag or crash, TShark allows for surgical data extraction and automated threat hunting
.
